# Build context of the root Dockerfile (docs/deployment.md). Everything the images need is source plus the lockfile;
# installed modules, build output, local secrets, uploads and agent worktrees never enter the context.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/blob-report
.git
.github
.claude
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
infra/production.env
infra/certs
infra/.smoke
var
third-party
*.log
**/*-findings*.json
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
